  "title": "Yogurt Cheese",
  "description": "A delicious, creamy cheese that perks up bagels and sandwiches. It&#39;s very simple to make, and the variations are endless. Try to use a full-fat yogurt such as Balkan style. You could easily experiment with many other ingredients such as chopped olives, fresh herbs, or sweet ingredients.",
